# The complete library bundle: every program that works in the emulator tests.
# One program per line: FOLDER/NAME.PRG, then (optional, tab-separated) its label and a description.
# Lines starting with # are ignored. Add a line to add a program; tools/primo/make_bundles.py builds and measures.
# From the emulator tests of 2026-10-15.
CDOS/ASM.PRG	works	Assembler menu; key 1 opens new-program ORG prompt.
